      "content": "\"whatever decision i make\"... that's a heavy thing to say. it's like you're saying it's actually okay to just... give up. to just stop everything. i feel like i've already lost everything that made life worth living anyway. if the world is just this hollow, dark place where being good gets you destroyed, is there even any dignity in sticking around to watch it happen?",
